Package: llomics
Title: Turn Omics Pipeline Results into Payloads for LLMs
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Builds small, self-describing JSON payloads from the results of
    statistical steps in omics pipelines (limma fits, Seurat marker tests, or
    any differential-analysis table), following the llomics contract. Each
    payload carries a run card, trust checks and one state per unit of
    judgment.
Authors@R: person("Ivan", "Osinnii", email = "osenniy.ivan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: jsonlite, stats, utils
Suggests: limma, Seurat, SeuratObject, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
